    {
      "id": "20261011-09-events-ledger-recovery-zone-title-0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 198,
      "width": 2340,
      "height": 32,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "A. 索引 / 规范链 / 幂等过账 / 持久通知的闭环",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:38.545Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:38.545Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-09-events-ledger-recovery-zone-1",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 980,
      "width": 2380,
      "height": 940,
      "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa",
      "strokeColor": "#ced4da",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:38.545Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:38.545Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-09-events-ledger-recovery-zone-title-1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 998,
      "width": 2340,
      "height": 32,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "B. 相互关联但不可混为一条的业务、授权和外层交易状态",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:38.545Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:38.545Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-09-events-ledger-recovery-chain",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 250,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 210,
      "backgroundColor": "#ebfbee",
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "1 / 链事实与合约状态\n充值 Transfer / 成功原生 trace\nSweep/Lot/Settlement/Withdrawal\nDisposition / Hold / Reserve / 控制事件\noperationStatus / requestStatus 交叉核验"
      },
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:38.545Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:38.545Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-09-events-ledger-recovery-canonical",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 650,
      "y": 250,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 210,
      "backgroundColor": "#f3e8ff",
      "strokeColor": "#9c36b5",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "2 / 索引器（规划）\n保存 blockHash / parentHash / canonical\n按日志/trace 覆盖回填和去重\n每链 finality profile，RPC 交叉核验\n有缺口/分歧时暂停相关新授权"
      },
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:38.545Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:38.545Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-09-events-ledger-recovery-decode",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 250,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 210,
      "backgroundColor": "#f3e8ff",
      "strokeColor": "#9c36b5",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "3 / 业务语义与唯一效果（规划）\n解码域、ID、来源/目标、金额/证据\n内部 movement 不算新用户充值\n匹配永久地址/订单与授权映射\n区分待确认、最终、风险和未知"
      },
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:38.545Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:38.545Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-09-events-ledger-recovery-post",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 1830,
      "y": 250,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 210,
      "backgroundColor": "#e3fafc",
      "strokeColor": "#0c8599",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "4 / PG 原子过账（规划）\n借贷相等、同租户、同资产\n不可变 journal / Hold / 业务状态\nlot/预留/movement 镜像 + Outbox\n经济唯一键，重放不重复冻结/付款"
      },
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:38.545Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:38.545Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-09-events-ledger-recovery-notify",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 1830,
      "y": 610,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 210,
      "backgroundColor": "#e7f5ff",
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "5 / Outbox / Webhook（规划）\ndeposit.risk_pending / credited / held\nwithdrawal.paid / cancelled\nstable eventId / 版本 / 平台签名\n持久至少一次，重试保存投递事实"
      },
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:38.546Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:38.546Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-09-events-ledger-recovery-consumer",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 610,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 210,
      "backgroundColor": "#e7f5ff",
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "6 / 租户接收方（规划）\n校验来源签名 / event schema\n事务去重 eventId\n已处理版本不重复经济效果\nACK 后可由 GET /v1/events 补拉"
      },
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:38.546Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:38.546Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-09-events-ledger-recovery-query",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 650,
      "y": 610,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 210,
      "backgroundColor": "#e7f5ff",
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "7 / 查询接口（规划）\nGET deposits / balances / withdrawals\n链确认 + 风险 + 入账/业务状态\nledger_seq / 规范高度与快照\n不得暴露其他租户或调查材料"
      },
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:38.546Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:38.546Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-09-events-ledger-recovery-reconcile",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 610,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 210,
      "backgroundColor": "#f3e8ff",
      "strokeColor": "#9c36b5",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "8 / 定期对账与异常（规划）\n同一规范高度核验全部控制地址\n资产/负债/权益；lot 与 consumed\n代码/角色/路由/epoch / nonce\n未知消费或异常 code hash 关闭 gate"
      },
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:38.546Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:38.546Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-09-events-ledger-recovery-business",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 1070,
      "width": 720,
      "height": 270,
      "backgroundColor": "#f3e8ff",
      "strokeColor": "#9c36b5",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "业务状态（示意，规划）\nRECEIVED → HELD → APPROVED\n→ AUTHORIZATION_POSSIBLE\n→ AUTHORIZED → EXECUTING\n→ FINAL_PAID\n或 CANCELLING → FINAL_CANCELLED。\n一个经济订单永久绑定请求域、金额/资产/收款人。"
      },
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:38.546Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:38.546Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-09-events-ledger-recovery-authorization",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 860,
      "y": 1070,
      "width": 720,
      "height": 270,
      "backgroundColor": "#f3e8ff",
      "strokeColor": "#9c36b5",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "授权事实（规划）\nPREPARED → SIGNING_POSSIBLE\n→ SIGNED / UNCERTAIN\n→ ONCHAIN_EXECUTED\n或 ONCHAIN_CANCELLED / INVALIDATED_FINAL。\noperation/requestId 在具体校验合约永久保存。\n签名不确定时不能认定“没有授权”。"
      },
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:38.546Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:38.546Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-09-events-ledger-recovery-transaction",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 1660,
      "y": 1070,
      "width": 720,
      "height": 270,
      "backgroundColor": "#f3e8ff",
      "strokeColor": "#9c36b5",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "外层 EOA 交易（规划）\nPREPARED → SIGNING_POSSIBLE\n→ SIGNED → BROADCAST → INCLUDED\n→ FINAL_SUCCESS / FINAL_REVERT\n或 UNCERTAIN；重组保留证据版本。\nEOA nonce 只管理一次外层尝试。\nFINAL_REVERT 不能代替业务永久取消。"
      },
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:38.546Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:38.546Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-09-events-ledger-recovery-reorg",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 1450,
      "width": 720,
      "height": 340,
      "backgroundColor": "#fff0f0",
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "重组与最终性故障\n旧观测先撤销有效性，再激活新规范事件。\n重新打包可能改变日志索引/结果。\n控制重组时本地 gate 不恢复。\n深重组用受审查 journal 冲正 cycle，\n不改历史分录、不直接改用户余额。\n缺口形成风险敞口；查询明确不确定。\n不凭服务器时钟判定签名过期。"
      },
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:38.546Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:38.546Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-09-events-ledger-recovery-recovery",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 860,
      "y": 1450,
      "width": 720,
      "height": 340,
      "backgroundColor": "#fff0f0",
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "旧 PG / 故障恢复\n先进入 RECOVERY_LOCKED。\n恢复发行映射、证据、签名和配置版本。\n从可靠共同 checkpoint 回放 logs/trace。\n核验每个域的已消费/取消请求和终态。\n对账通过前不开放新地址/出金。\n链日志没有完整用户归属和链下批准，\n不能仅靠区块重建全部平台事实。"
      },
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:38.546Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:38.546Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-09-events-ledger-recovery-checkpoint",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 1660,
      "y": 1450,
      "width": 720,
      "height": 340,
      "backgroundColor": "#e3fafc",
      "strokeColor": "#0c8599",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "联合 checkpoint 与数值约束\nchain height/hash + 覆盖水位\nregistry/config version + ledger_seq\n比较所有池/Vault/Relayer 的同资产快照。\n链金额 U256；PG NUMERIC 显式整数/上界 CHECK。\n金额/手续费/Gas按各自资产独立凭证。\n链/RPC/KYT/签名在短 PG 事务外执行，\n返回后 CAS 版本重校验。"
      },
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:38.546Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:38.546Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-09-events-ledger-recovery-note0",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 1990,
      "width": 2320,
      "height": 115,
      "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa",
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "通用接入：HTTP nonce 每次尝试更新，Idempotency-Key/商户订单保持不变；同键不同业务载荷拒绝。\nAPI 通信身份、EIP-712 资金授权和 EOA 交易签名各自分域；不要把业务命令变成任意 digest / calldata 签名服务。"
      },
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:38.546Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:23:38.546Z",
      "version": 1
    },
